        <p>引入编辑距离与BERT语义相似度的模糊Source匹配，恢复跨库CFG，采用LCO-RDA轻量级数据流分析替代符号执行。</p>

  - elementId: card2-sub2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 400, 320, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>关键数据</strong></p>

  - elementId: card2-body2
