  # ===== EVOLUTION SUMMARY =====
  - elementId: evo-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 646, 1160, 40]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$soft"

  - elementId: evo-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 646, 1120, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>技术演进路径：<strong>硬编码精确匹配</strong>  →  <strong>模糊匹配（编辑距离 + BERT）</strong>  →  <strong>LLM 语义理解（结构化 URI-Key 建模）</strong></p>

  # ===== FOOTER =====
